ent-OrbitraProstheticArm = basic prosthetic arm
    .desc = Fits either shoulder. The mechanical hand takes 15% longer to perform timed actions.
ent-OrbitraProstheticLeg = basic prosthetic leg
    .desc = Fits either hip and includes a foot. Walking and running speed is 90% of normal while using a basic leg.
ent-OrbitraAdvancedProstheticArm = advanced prosthetic arm
    .desc = A powered arm with a precision hand. Fits either shoulder and restores full hand speed.
ent-OrbitraAdvancedProstheticLeg = advanced prosthetic leg
    .desc = A powered leg with an articulated foot. Fits either hip and restores full movement speed.
